{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42285","headline":"题白鹤庙 · 徐铉","name":"题白鹤庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生心事向玄关，一入仙乡似旧山。\n白鹤泪空晴眇眇，丹沙流涧暮潺潺。\n尝嗟多病嫌中药，拟问真经乞小还。\n满洞烟霞互陵乱，何峰台榭是萧闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42285.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42285","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}